From 5b88190cb2c3b8e2386c1ab4e9a4a4fe5cfce702 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:16:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 045/144] net: ipa: add SM8750 compatible

SM8750 has IPA v5.5.2, like Eliza. The OnePlus SM8750 downstream
driver uses the same 68-counter Q6 FnR memory layout and the same
endpoint map as the Eliza data, so reuse ipa_data_v5_5_eliza.

List both qcom,sm8750-ipa and qcom,eliza-ipa as standalone
compatibles with no qcom,sm8550-ipa fallback. Move Eliza out of the
SM8550 fallback list while adding SM8750.

Assisted-by: Grok Bot
Signed-off-by: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 7c87550714d011f5f92e2c11c3938fcaa27e0dee)

Import-Patch: pkgs/linux-kernel/sm8750/dodge/patches/7.3/0063-net-ipa-add-SM8750-compatible.patch
